*

# Only what the build actually needs. No build.rs / vergen in the tree, so
# .git is not required to compile.
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!clippy.toml
!core/
!backend/
!clients/
!dev/

# Build outputs and deps that must never be copied into the build context —
# they are rebuilt inside the image and would poison the cache mounts.
target/
**/target/
backend/llm-sidecar/node_modules/
backend/llm-sidecar/dist/
